    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/44d20175220f78416c327fb3fe83b3c7.poster.avif?t=1705582730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/44d20175220f78416c327fb3fe83b3c7.webm?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/44d20175220f78416c327fb3fe83b3c7.mp4?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in the captivating world of this hidden object adventure, where you'll explore a variety of locations with unique tasks that will challenge your detective skills. Classic hidden object scenes with named items, shadow silhouettes, and thrilling &quot;find the difference&quot; puzzles are just the beginning. You'll be drawn into the heart of the mystery as you navigate through a collection of diverse and intriguing scenarios that will put your observation skills to the test.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/959ab8d99c158eefaf80dc77acbf5d30.poster.avif?t=1705582730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/959ab8d99c158eefaf80dc77acbf5d30.webm?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/959ab8d99c158eefaf80dc77acbf5d30.mp4?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>But the excitement doesn't stop there! This game also features engaging puzzles that add another layer of entertainment to your crime-solving adventure. Exercise your strategic thinking and quick reflexes as you clear the board of colorful jewels, uncovering precious artifacts and unlocking hidden secrets along the way. With each successful match, you'll be one step closer to uncovering the truth behind the criminal underworld.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/215ce1e7483a50032b72f2ea336ce2eb.poster.avif?t=1705582730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/215ce1e7483a50032b72f2ea336ce2eb.webm?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/215ce1e7483a50032b72f2ea336ce2eb.mp4?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join the ranks of the elite detectives in a secret organization, and embark on a riveting story of adventure and intrigue. You'll be tasked with finding unique treasures and collections, and as you do, you'll uncover the enigmatic tale of a secret society that operates in the shadows. Travel across three continents, from the bustling streets of New York to the exotic landscapes of Asia, uncovering hidden gems and solving crimes that have stumped the world's finest detectives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/5cdf8c2252994023f8b9e3202eae6881.poster.avif?t=1705582730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/5cdf8c2252994023f8b9e3202eae6881.webm?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/5cdf8c2252994023f8b9e3202eae6881.mp4?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you dive deeper into the game, you'll collect unique artifacts and objects, forming stunning collections that reveal the rich history and secrets of the secret organization. With each new discovery, you'll gain valuable rewards and unlock powerful tools to aid you in your quest. Share your progress with friends, trade items, and join forces to uncover the hidden truth that lies beneath the surface. With a vast array of hidden object scenes, puzzles, and a captivating story, this hidden object adventure is the ultimate game for both new and experienced players alike.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/a5353e4b07328618c7979a943553e82f.poster.avif?t=1705582730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/a5353e4b07328618c7979a943553e82f.webm?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/a5353e4b07328618c7979a943553e82f.mp4?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/44d20175220f78416c327fb3fe83b3c7.poster.avif?t=1705582730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/44d20175220f78416c327fb3fe83b3c7.webm?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/44d20175220f78416c327fb3fe83b3c7.mp4?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in the captivating world of this hidden object adventure, where you'll explore a variety of locations with unique tasks that will challenge your detective skills. Classic hidden object scenes with named items, shadow silhouettes, and thrilling &quot;find the difference&quot; puzzles are just the beginning. You'll be drawn into the heart of the mystery as you navigate through a collection of diverse and intriguing scenarios that will put your observation skills to the test.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/959ab8d99c158eefaf80dc77acbf5d30.poster.avif?t=1705582730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/959ab8d99c158eefaf80dc77acbf5d30.webm?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/959ab8d99c158eefaf80dc77acbf5d30.mp4?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>But the excitement doesn't stop there! This game also features engaging puzzles that add another layer of entertainment to your crime-solving adventure. Exercise your strategic thinking and quick reflexes as you clear the board of colorful jewels, uncovering precious artifacts and unlocking hidden secrets along the way. With each successful match, you'll be one step closer to uncovering the truth behind the criminal underworld.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/215ce1e7483a50032b72f2ea336ce2eb.poster.avif?t=1705582730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/215ce1e7483a50032b72f2ea336ce2eb.webm?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/215ce1e7483a50032b72f2ea336ce2eb.mp4?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join the ranks of the elite detectives in a secret organization, and embark on a riveting story of adventure and intrigue. You'll be tasked with finding unique treasures and collections, and as you do, you'll uncover the enigmatic tale of a secret society that operates in the shadows. Travel across three continents, from the bustling streets of New York to the exotic landscapes of Asia, uncovering hidden gems and solving crimes that have stumped the world's finest detectives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/5cdf8c2252994023f8b9e3202eae6881.poster.avif?t=1705582730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/5cdf8c2252994023f8b9e3202eae6881.webm?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/5cdf8c2252994023f8b9e3202eae6881.mp4?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you dive deeper into the game, you'll collect unique artifacts and objects, forming stunning collections that reveal the rich history and secrets of the secret organization. With each new discovery, you'll gain valuable rewards and unlock powerful tools to aid you in your quest. Share your progress with friends, trade items, and join forces to uncover the hidden truth that lies beneath the surface. With a vast array of hidden object scenes, puzzles, and a captivating story, this hidden object adventure is the ultimate game for both new and experienced players alike.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/a5353e4b07328618c7979a943553e82f.poster.avif?t=1705582730\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/a5353e4b07328618c7979a943553e82f.webm?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367650/extras/a5353e4b07328618c7979a943553e82f.mp4?t=1705582730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
